## Flow 2: ReportDecision — Notify Contributor on Approval/Rejection

**Purpose:** When a Supervisor approves or rejects a report, the Contributor (who submitted it) gets an email.

### Step 1: Create the Flow

1. Go to **https://make.powerautomate.com**
2. Click **+ Create** → **Automated cloud flow**
3. Flow name: `APP-MRMS Report Decision Notify Contributor`
4. Trigger: `When an item is created or modified` (SharePoint)
5. **Site Address:** Same SharePoint site
6. **List Name:** `MonthlyReports`

### Step 2: Add Trigger Conditions

1. Click **⋯** on the trigger → **Settings** → **Trigger Conditions**
2. Add condition 1:
   ```
   @equals(triggerBody()?['ReportStatus']?['Value'], 'Supervisor Approved')
   ```
3. Add condition 2:
   ```
   @equals(triggerBody()?['ReportStatus']?['Value'], 'Supervisor Rejected')
   ```
4. Add condition 3:
   ```
   @equals(triggerBody()?['ReportStatus']?['Value'], 'M&E Approved')
   ```
5. Add condition 4:
   ```
   @equals(triggerBody()?['ReportStatus']?['Value'], 'M&E Rejected')
   ```
6. Click **Done**

### Step 3: Add a Condition to Split Approved vs Rejected

1. Click **+ New step** → Search for `Condition`
2. **Condition:** `ReportStatus` **is equal to** `Supervisor Rejected` **OR** `ReportStatus` **is equal to** `M&E Rejected`
   > In the condition builder: `ReportStatus Value` `is equal to` `Supervisor Rejected`

### Step 4A: If Yes (Rejected) — Send Rejection Email

1. In the **If yes** branch, click **Add an action** → `Send an email (V2)` (Office 365 Outlook)
2. **To:** `SubmittedBy Email` (from Dynamic content → trigger)
3. **Subject:**
   ```
   Report Rejected: @{triggerBody()?['Title']} — @{triggerBody()?['ReportingMonth']?['Value']}
   ```
4. **Body:** (HTML mode)
   ```html
   <p><strong>Your monthly report has been rejected and requires correction.</strong></p>
   <table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;">
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Report</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['Title']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Activity</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['Activity']?['Value']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Reporting Month</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['ReportingMonth']?['Value']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Status</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['ReportStatus']?['Value']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#fff0f0;"><strong>Rejection Reason</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['SupervisorRejectionReason']}</td></tr>
   </table>
   <p>Please open the <strong>APP-MRMS</strong> application, correct the report, and resubmit.</p>
   <p><em>This is an automated notification from the APP Monthly Reporting Management System.</em></p>
   ```

5. **Importance:** `High`

### Step 4B: If No (Approved) — Send Approval Email

1. In the **If no** branch, click **Add an action** → `Send an email (V2)` (Office 365 Outlook)
2. **To:** `SubmittedBy Email` (from Dynamic content → trigger)
3. **Subject:**
   ```
   Report Approved: @{triggerBody()?['Title']} — @{triggerBody()?['ReportingMonth']?['Value']}
   ```
4. **Body:** (HTML mode)
   ```html
   <p><strong>Your monthly report has been approved.</strong></p>
   <table border="1" cellpadding="6" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse; font-family:Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif;">
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Report</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['Title']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Activity</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['Activity']?['Value']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Reporting Month</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['ReportingMonth']?['Value']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Status</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['ReportStatus']?['Value']}</td></tr>
     <tr><td style="background:#f0f0f0;"><strong>Reviewed By</strong></td><td>@{triggerBody()?['SupervisorReviewedBy']?['DisplayName']}</td></tr>
   </table>
   <p>No further action is required.</p>
   <p><em>This is an automated notification from the APP Monthly Reporting Management System.</em></p>
   ```

5. **Importance:** `Normal`

### Step 5: Save and Test

1. Click **Save**
2. Test by changing `ReportStatus` on a MonthlyReport item to `Supervisor Rejected`
3. Verify the Contributor receives the rejection email with the reason
4. Test again with `Supervisor Approved` — verify the approval email

