## Importing Flows via Package

Instead of building flows manually, you can import the pre-built package:

1. Use `tools/build_flow_zips.py` to rebuild with your site URL and list GUIDs
2. Import via **My flows → Import → Package (.zip)** in the Power Automate portal
3. Bind connections (SharePoint + Outlook) and turn on each flow

> 📘 **Full reference:** See [`docs/power-automate/flow-import-export.md`](docs/power-automate/flow-import-export.md) for the import process, validation rules, and package format. See [`docs/power-automate/definition-json-reference.md`](docs/power-automate/definition-json-reference.md) for the `definition.json` structure.

> 📘 **Validation findings:** See [`docs/flow_import_validation_findings.md`](docs/flow_import_validation_findings.md) for the exact import errors encountered and their fixes.

